{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/extras/03668d70ebf5c9183ff613853e213606.poster.avif?t=1760228723\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/extras/03668d70ebf5c9183ff613853e213606.gif?t=1760228723\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Molitva</strong> \u2013 a brutal, nonlinear visual novel about sins committed and the final chance for redemption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the moment of suicide, when despair overwhelms the soul, a plea for forgiveness is heard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And God responds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chance granted from above \u2014 three days in the Borderland, a fragile world where it is still possible to find a path to liberation from sin. Here, the past comes to life, and each choice brings one closer either to salvation or to final oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/extras/2541cb9febe4c37a3591bf814eea6e6a.poster.avif?t=1760228723\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/extras/2541cb9febe4c37a3591bf814eea6e6a.webp?t=1760228723\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version introduces the beginning of this agonizing path. You will experience the first, deceptively calm day in this purgatory. The culmination of this introduction will be the first dream, which will reveal part of the truth about your sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/extras/b2cf56d48c5d885a02e5109ad5631392.avif?t=1760228723\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the past leaves you as nothing more than fertilizer for graveyard weeds, there remains only one question: Are you worthy of forgiveness?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913680?t=1760228723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/3056eeb58187bf046b3d2a615123e3a037454e66/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760228723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/3f37212f1dfcbfbbf60044c340b731940c2852c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760228723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/3f37212f1dfcbfbbf60044c340b731940c2852c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760228723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game includes depictions of suicide and violence, presented in an artistic and non-realistic manner. These scenes are part of the narrative. Please be advised if you are sensitive to such topics."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/extras/03668d70ebf5c9183ff613853e213606.poster.avif?t=1760228723\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913680/extras/03668d70ebf5c9183ff6